id: pm-todos-sdk-status-host
title: Respect workspace terminal roles and use host-bound TODO operations
description: Verified F04 and F09 at origin/main 16c0bd20e74249bb79e54479cd569bf21815fe32. Replace duplicated lifecycle and process transport contracts with the public SDK while retaining TODO fidelity and partial-import receipts.
