acceptance_criteria: "F04: custom terminal roles export completed and import with close evidence; prove the status wiring revert fails.; F09: host-bound complete reads and mutations work without git or a pm executable, retain author and source metadata; prove transport revert fails."
resolution: "Uses declared terminal lifecycle roles and host-bound complete reads/mutations with native closure evidence, preserved authorship and real no-git/no-executable regressions."
expected_result: "F04: custom terminal roles export completed and import with close evidence; prove the status wiring revert fails.; F09: host-bound complete reads and mutations work without git or a pm executable, retain author and source metadata; prove transport revert fails."
